{
  "about": [
    "What a press on a Task or a Commitment writes, as data: the status step, `Alt+Enter`, the Compound",
    "refusal and the verdict.",
    "",
    "Both evaluators replay it. `src-tauri/tests/operations/task_gestures_conformance.rs` runs every case",
    "through `tasks::rules::gestures`; `src/utils/task-gestures-conformance.test.ts` runs the same cases",
    "through `src/utils/task-gestures.ts`, which the board uses to show a press before the server has",
    "answered it (ADR 0012, decision 13). Neither side generates this file: it is written by hand from",
    "`docs/spec/resources.md`.",
    "",
    "`next_status`: one step of click/`Enter` in the model a Task holds. `alt_step`: `Alt+Enter`; refused",
    "on Agentic work that is not Doing. `status_after`: a step on a Task that is or is not Compound; a",
    "Compound Task has no status of its own to write, whatever the gesture. `verdict_after`: the cycle key",
    "and the Kept and Broken controls, each of which clears the verdict it already reads.",
    "",
    "A result is `written` with the status it leaves, or `refused` with why nothing is written."
